  "notes": "{生産|せいさん} means production or manufacturing. As a verbal noun, it forms {生産|せいさん}する (to produce/manufacture).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～を{生産|せいさん}する: to produce ~\n- {生産|せいさん}{量|りょう}: production volume\n- {生産|せいさん}コスト: production cost\n- {生産|せいさん}{性|せい}: productivity\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {生産者|せいさんしゃ}: producer\n- {大量|たいりょう}{生産|せいさん}: mass production\n- {国内|こくない}{生産|せいさん}: domestic production\n- {生産|せいさん}{工場|こうじょう}: manufacturing plant\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {製造|せいぞう}: manufacturing (industrial focus)\n- {製作|せいさく}: production (creative/artistic)\n- {作成|さくせい}: creation (documents, plans)",
